zhlnew::
T10,<	SWE	<
Kommandot beh|ver veta p} vilken fil den nygenererade databasen skall lagras.
Om inte annat anges, antas utrustningsnamnet DSK: och extension NEW. Om inte
annat anges, kopieras filnamnsdel och skyddskod fr}n original-databasen.>
	NOR	<
Kommandoen vil  ha namnet p} den fil den nygenererade databasen skall lagras.
Default device er DSK:. Default extension er NEW. Default filenavn og
skyddskod er fra original-databasen.>
	ENG	<
The command needs to know the name of the output file for the generated new
data base. Default device is DSK:, file name is same as the original file,
extension is .NEW, and protection is same as for original file.>
	GER	<
The command needs to know the name of the output file for the generated new
data base. Default device is DSK:, file name is same as the original file,
extension is .NEW, and protection is same as for original file.>
	FRE	<
The command needs to know the name of the output file for the generated new
data base. Default device is DSK:, file name is same as the original file,
extension is .NEW, and protection is same as for original file.>
>;T10
