FIRST (LINES) N to get the beginning of each entry
BEFORE date-and-time Will tell COM to only output entries created
		     before the specified date and time.
AFTER date-and-time  Will tell COM to only output entries created
		     after the specified date and time.
HELP to get a compact list of review parameters>

